    "q-222989": {
      "dom_id": "step-q222989",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Insert the missing number in the division problem below.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<table align=\"center\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"3\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\" align=\"center\">$÷$</td>\n<td width=\"25\" height=\"25\" align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"25\" align=\"center\">$=$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<table align=\"center\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
      "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{1}{5}$ on the left and $\\frac{1}{35}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129811/assets/3446d5184d3cd128aabaf7f571973e621c1c0c612b01418f1d470bdb616d5ccd.png)\n\nThe division operation splits the shaded region on the left into $7$ equal parts. So the shaded part on the left is $7$ times larger than the shaded part on the right. \n\nTherefore, the division problem shown is:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{5}÷7=\\frac{1}{35}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $7.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
