      "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{1}{3}$ on the left.\n\nSince we need to divide by $6$, we split the whole into $6$ equal parts horizontally.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129811/assets/d664abadcc567c7b5360821b776309501ef3965ef6b0237a52b3557e7340cd79.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{1}{18}$ of the whole.\n\nThe missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129811/assets/5ebb3fd718d86f697862763fedffbf2a2d62f90cc1ca8c337c03bb965198759a.png)",
